## Upstream data

The underlying records come from the Registro Nacional de Personas Desaparecidas y No
Localizadas (RNPDNO), published by the Comisión Nacional de Búsqueda / SEGOB. That
source data is Mexican government open data; this licence covers Umbral's processing,
structuring and documentation of it, not the underlying records.

Cite as the dashboard's own citation block states, including the snapshot tag — the
register is live and its counts change between queries.
